  "prefLabel": "Lab 705.01 First Request to be Granted",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 705.01 First Request to be Granted. If an injured employee who is covered by a managed care program is dissatisfied with a determination made by the program relating to compensability, degree of disability or degree of impairment arising from an injury, the injured employee may apply to the commissioner for authorization to obtain an independent examination and report thereof by a health care provider of the injured employee's choice. The commissioner shall grant one such authorization as a matter of course.\n\nSource.. #7338, eff 8-2-00; ss by #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab700.html"
}
